{
  "id": "otr_mac_adiff",
  "display_name": "Apple Silicon MPS -- AnimateDiff haunted lane (Mac-only, ADDITIVE). Same M4/16 GB substrate as otr_mac_mps: kokoro voices, stable_audio_3 music, Qwen3.5-4B writer on Metal at quant_policy none. The ONE difference is the three video roles, which run animatediff15_v3_haunted_video instead of the procgen visualizers -- SD1.5 + the v3 motion module + the v3 domain adapter, about 3.65 GB and the cheapest complete video lane in the pack (the 4060 measured 4.9 GB fully resident, no offload). It is text_to_video, so it mints NO still and the image roles are inert. NEEDS the pinned ComfyUI-AnimateDiff-Evolved pack AND an extra_model_paths entry for 'animatediff_models', which Comfy Desktop does not generate -- see docs/MAC_PORTABILITY_GUIDE.md section 8. Exists as its own profile so the 5080's haunted lane and otr_mac_mps are both untouched.",
  "status": "draft",
  "platform": "mac",
  "device_backend": "mps",
  "gpu_vendor": "apple",
  "toolchains": [],
  "allow_sidecars": false,
  "role_overrides": {
